    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d168">

                <pb facs="0281" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.21/278.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Thomson to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-17T17:00:00-04:56">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 17, 1914, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>As a last resort, its opponents have instituted proceedings in the Supreme Court
                    to test the constitutionality of the law by which Congress approved the treaty.*
                    * * I do not consider that any importance whatever should be attached to this
                    surely fruitless attack. * * *</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
